<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Sept import prices falls 0.7 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Sept import prices falls 0.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian import prices fell 0.7 percent in September from the previous month and were 6.4 percent lower than a year before, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said on Friday.</p>
</text>
